sequenceDiagram
    participant B as C1事件总线
    participant T as TelemetryClient(客户端)
    participant Q as 本地队列
    participant V as TelemetryIngestView
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    B->>T: 订阅 run_started/room_cleared/run_ended/app_error
    B->>T: emit(run_ended, {...})
    T->>Q: 组装并入队(不 await)
    Q->>V: POST /api/telemetry/events (sendBeacon)
    V->>V: TelemetryBatchSerializer 批量校验
    V->>DB: bulk_create(TelemetryEvent...)
    V-->>T: 202 Accepted
    T->>Q: 清除已确认事件
